flowchart LR
    A[Page component] --> B[Feature hook useX]
    B --> C[React Query queryFn]
    C --> D[Service function]
    D --> E[supabase-js: from/rpc/functions.invoke]
    E --> F{JWT attached?}
    F -- yes --> G[PostgREST]
    F -- edge --> H[Edge Function]
